        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "子どもは不注意から落し物をよくしてしまう。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "この道は暗いので、落し物をしやすい場所だ。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "重い荷物を持っているので、落し物をしないよう気をつけなくては。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      }
